qemu-arm, as built by beanjar-vendor (qemu-user/)

This program is QEMU's 32-bit ARM user-mode emulator from the release named in BUILDINFO, built
from the upstream release tarball (https://download.qemu.org/) with the patches in
beanjar-vendor's qemu-user/patches/ applied, by the build script next to them, and linked
statically with Debian's GLib, PCRE2, zlib and GNU C Library, whose packages BUILDINFO names.

